LanguageData.RP_CustodyText:
The state has a small group of minimum and medium security inmates it wants rehabilitated, and asks whether you will take them under contract.

The cohort ({0}) - the official file, nothing more.
{3}

The state pays the fee on each inmate's admission, and the bonus at the end of that inmate's own {1} days inside, for each who attended at least {2} class sessions in them. Fees come to {4}, bonuses to {5} at most.

What it asks of the prison - {6}

Beds free against beds needed - {7}.

They come on the daily shuttle, after the state's own returning prisoners, and must be admitted within {8} days of signing. {10}

The offer stands for {9} days. Decline it, prepare the beds, the classroom and the counsellors first (postpone the letter), or sign and give up other work for the classes.
